    schema:description "Class-level shapes for the Ecological Monitoring System - Australia (EMSA). This shapes graph is a profile of the TERN Ontology shapes. It restates three TERN constraints so that they allow the cases that are specific to EMSA, and it must be loaded together with the TERN Ontology shapes and the EMSA protocol shapes." ;
